			"color":"#4b5563",
			"widgets_values":[
				"Warm baritone lead, ethereal female harmonies. Acoustic folk (72BPM). Guitar/piano base, harmonica interlude, swelling strings. Nostalgic, intimate. Structure: Verse-Chorus-Female Humming Interlude-Bridge-Climax-Female Outro. Dynamic build, fade end. Vocal-focused mix, plate reverb on female vocals, tape saturation."
